** Probe: group continuation cards. SOGRP, OLMGRP, PSDGRP and BLPGRP
** detect a continuation by a repeated group ID but never reset the
** group index, so a continuation card that is not adjacent to its
** group is filed under the LAST group defined. EPA's no2_1yrAK_olmgrp
** deck ends "SRCGROUP ALL BACKGROUND"; a rewrite that put a bare
** "SRCGROUP ALL" first and the BACKGROUND card after the other groups
** ran clean but gave the ALL group without background (slope 0.80
** against EPA's POSTFILE). The BACKGROUND / NOBACKGROUND flag is a field
** of the card that defines ALL, so pyaermod writes it there and keeps
** every group's cards together.
CO STARTING
   TITLEONE  oracle 15: SRCGROUP ALL BACKGROUND on the defining card
   MODELOPT  CONC  FLAT  DFAULT
   AVERTIME  1  ANNUAL
   POLLUTID  SO2
   RUNORNOT  NOT
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
   LOCATION  STACK1  POINT  0.0  0.0  0.0
   SRCPARAM  STACK1  500.0  65.00  425.  15.0  5.
   LOCATION  STACK2  POINT  50.0  0.0  0.0
   SRCPARAM  STACK2  500.0  65.00  425.  15.0  5.
   BACKGRND  ANNUAL  5.0
   SRCGROUP  ALL  BACKGROUND
   SRCGROUP  STK  STACK1
   SRCGROUP  STK  STACK2
   SRCGROUP  BGD  BACKGROUND
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
   DISCCART  500.0  500.0  0.0
RE FINISHED

ME STARTING
   SURFFILE  AERMET2.SFC
   PROFFILE  AERMET2.PFL
   SURFDATA  14735  1988
   UAIRDATA  14735  1988
   PROFBASE  0.0  METERS
ME FINISHED

OU STARTING
   RECTABLE  ALLAVE  FIRST
OU FINISHED
